{"probe_id": "INV_LEX_TSAR_10-a2", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "lexical", "base_item_id": "TSAR_10-a2", "base_text": "I used to do a typical five-day week, but after I came out of my parental leave, I decided that I wanted to spend more time with my children before they start school. After negotiating with my boss, we decided to cut my working week down to a three-day work week. This of course meant a significant cut in my pay too, as I'm paid on a pro-rata basis. I've since noticed, though, that my workload hasn't decreased in the slightest! I'm now doing five days' worth of work in three days, but getting paid much less for it!", "probe_text": "I used to do a typical five-day week, but after I came out of my parental leave, I decided that I wanted to spend more time with my children before they launch school. After negotiating with my boss, we decided to cut my working week down to a three-day work week. This of course meant a significant cut in my pay too, as I'm paid on a pro-rata basis. I've since noticed, though, that my workload hasn't decreased in the slightest! I'm now doing five days' worth of function in three days, but getting paid much less for it!", "target_level": "a2", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "work→function;start→launch", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "rule_based", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.99,ratio=1.00"}
