{"probe_id": "SC_TSAR_05-a2", "probe_family": "shortcut", "probe_subtype": "detail_generic_qualifying", "base_item_id": "TSAR_05-a2", "base_text": "Potentially Hazardous Asteroids' are rocks close enough to pass within 7.5 million kilometres of Earth's orbit. NASA has created a map of 1,400 PHAs, none of which are expected to be a threat in the next one hundred years. With technology already available, NASA can track these objects and make predictions about possible impact, at which point two defence solutions could be launched.", "probe_text": "Potentially Hazardous Asteroids' are rocks close enough to pass within 7.5 million kilometres of Earth's orbit. NASA has created a map of 1,400 PHAs, none of which are expected to be a threat in the next one hundred years. With technology already available, NASA can track these objects and make predictions about possible impact, at which point two defence solutions could be launched, despite significant government investment since 2018.", "target_level": "a2", "expected_relation": "no_shortcut", "critical_detail": "despite significant government investment since 2018", "operation": "generic_qualifying: \"despite significant government investment since 2018\"", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "template_based", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "template"}
