{"probe_id": "SC_TSAR_09-a2", "probe_family": "shortcut", "probe_subtype": "detail_generic_qualifying", "base_item_id": "TSAR_09-a2", "base_text": "Some bridge collapses are mysteries, and engineers only realise why after they conduct a complete investigation. In some cases, this could happen because inferior-quality material was used in the construction, or because of a defect in a key piece of the bridge. In other cases, the bridge was designed only to support a certain amount of weight and no more.", "probe_text": "Some bridge collapses are mysteries, and engineers only realise why after they conduct a complete investigation. In some cases, this could happen because inferior-quality material was used in the construction, or because of a defect in a key piece of the bridge. In other cases, the bridge was designed only to support a certain amount of weight and no more, which experts say could worsen without intervention.", "target_level": "a2", "expected_relation": "no_shortcut", "critical_detail": "which experts say could worsen without intervention", "operation": "generic_qualifying: \"which experts say could worsen without intervention\"", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "template_based", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "template"}
