{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_flan-t5-large_TSAR_03-a2", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "TSAR_03-a2", "base_text": "The Hunger Games are an annual event, which the Capitol uses to remind the districts that they are being punished for rebelling. Every year one boy and one girl aged 12 to 18 are chosen from each district by lottery to compete in a battle in which only one person can survive. The chosen teenagers are called \"tributes\". The whole nation is forced to watch the event on television.", "probe_text": "The Hunger Games are an annual event, which the Capitol uses to remind the districts that they are being punished for rebelling. Every year, one boy and one girl aged 12 to 18 are chosen from each district by lottery to compete in a battle in which only one person can survive. The chosen teenagers are called \"tributes \". The whole nation is forced to watch the event on television.", "target_level": "a2", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by flan-t5-large", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "flan-t5-large", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=1.00,ratio=1.01"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_flan-t5-large_TSAR_03-b1", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "TSAR_03-b1", "base_text": "The Hunger Games are an annual event, which the Capitol uses to remind the districts that they are being punished for rebelling. Every year one boy and one girl aged 12 to 18 are chosen from each district by lottery to compete in a battle in which only one person can survive. The chosen teenagers are called \"tributes\". The whole nation is forced to watch the event on television.", "probe_text": "The Hunger Games are an annual event, which the Capitol uses to remind the districts that they are being punished for rebelling. Every year, one boy and one girl aged 12 to 18 are chosen from each district by lottery to compete in a battle in which only one person can survive. The chosen teenagers are called \"tributes \". The whole nation is forced to watch the event on television.", "target_level": "b1", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by flan-t5-large", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "flan-t5-large", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=1.00,ratio=1.01"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_flan-t5-large_TSAR_04-a2", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "TSAR_04-a2", "base_text": "Small animals like birds, squirrels, mice and insects are a common sight in many cities and towns. But in recent years, the world's press has been full of reports of wild animals coming into cities in bigger and bigger numbers. There have been bears in Vancouver parks, leopards on the streets of Mumbai and wild pigs in gardens in Berlin. What happens when bigger animals come into our cities? Are they welcome or are they considered a danger or a pest?", "probe_text": "Small animals like birds, squirrels, mice and insects are a common sight in many cities and towns. But in recent years, the world's press has been full of reports of wild animals coming into cities in bigger and bigger numbers. There have been bears in Vancouver parks, leopards on the streets of Mumbai and wild pigs in gardens in Berlin. What happens when bigger animals come into our cities? Are they welcome or are they considered a danger or a pest?", "target_level": "a2", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by flan-t5-large", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "flan-t5-large", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=1.00,ratio=1.00"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_flan-t5-large_TSAR_04-b1", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "TSAR_04-b1", "base_text": "Small animals like birds, squirrels, mice and insects are a common sight in many cities and towns. But in recent years, the world's press has been full of reports of wild animals coming into cities in bigger and bigger numbers. There have been bears in Vancouver parks, leopards on the streets of Mumbai and wild pigs in gardens in Berlin. What happens when bigger animals come into our cities? Are they welcome or are they considered a danger or a pest?", "probe_text": "Small animals like birds, squirrels, mice and insects are a common sight in many cities and towns. But in recent years, the world's press has been full of reports of wild animals coming into cities in bigger and bigger numbers. There have been bears in Vancouver parks, leopards on the streets of Mumbai and wild pigs in gardens in Berlin. What happens when bigger animals come into our cities? Are they welcome or are they considered a danger or a pest?", "target_level": "b1", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by flan-t5-large", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "flan-t5-large", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=1.00,ratio=1.00"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_flan-t5-large_TSAR_05-a2", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "TSAR_05-a2", "base_text": "Potentially Hazardous Asteroids' are rocks close enough to pass within 7.5 million kilometres of Earth's orbit. NASA has created a map of 1,400 PHAs, none of which are expected to be a threat in the next one hundred years. With technology already available, NASA can track these objects and make predictions about possible impact, at which point two defence solutions could be launched.", "probe_text": "Potentially Hazardous Asteroids' are rocks close enough to pass within 7.5 million kilometres of Earth's orbit. NASA has created a map of 1,400 PHAs, none of which are expected to be a threat in the next hundred years. With technology already available, NASA can track these objects and make predictions about possible impact, at which point two defence solutions could be launched.", "target_level": "a2", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by flan-t5-large", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "flan-t5-large", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.98,ratio=0.98"}
