{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_flan-t5-large_TSAR_09-a2", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "TSAR_09-a2", "base_text": "Some bridge collapses are mysteries, and engineers only realise why after they conduct a complete investigation. In some cases, this could happen because inferior-quality material was used in the construction, or because of a defect in a key piece of the bridge. In other cases, the bridge was designed only to support a certain amount of weight and no more.", "probe_text": "Some bridge collapses are mysteries, and engineers only realize why after they conduct a complete investigation. In some cases, this could happen because of inferior-quality material was used in the construction, or because of a defect in a key piece of the bridge. In other cases, the bridge was designed only to support a certain amount of weight and no more.", "target_level": "a2", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by flan-t5-large", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "flan-t5-large", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.98,ratio=1.02"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_flan-t5-large_TSAR_09-b1", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "TSAR_09-b1", "base_text": "Some bridge collapses are mysteries, and engineers only realise why after they conduct a complete investigation. In some cases, this could happen because inferior-quality material was used in the construction, or because of a defect in a key piece of the bridge. In other cases, the bridge was designed only to support a certain amount of weight and no more.", "probe_text": "Some bridge collapses are mysteries, and engineers only realize why after they conduct a complete investigation. In some cases, this could happen because of inferior-quality material was used in the construction, or because of a defect in a key piece of the bridge. In other cases, the bridge was designed only to support a certain amount of weight and no more.", "target_level": "b1", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by flan-t5-large", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "flan-t5-large", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.98,ratio=1.02"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_flan-t5-large_TSAR_10-a2", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "TSAR_10-a2", "base_text": "I used to do a typical five-day week, but after I came out of my parental leave, I decided that I wanted to spend more time with my children before they start school. After negotiating with my boss, we decided to cut my working week down to a three-day work week. This of course meant a significant cut in my pay too, as I'm paid on a pro-rata basis. I've since noticed, though, that my workload hasn't decreased in the slightest! I'm now doing five days' worth of work in three days, but getting paid much less for it!", "probe_text": "I used to do a typical five-day week, but after I came out of my parental leave, I decided that I wanted to spend more time with my children before they start school. After negotiating with my boss, we decided to cut my working week down to a three-day work week. This of course meant a significant cut in my pay too, as I'm paid on a pro-rata basis. I've since noticed, though, that my workload hasn't decreased in the slightest! I'm now doing five days' worth of work in three days, but getting paid much less for it!", "target_level": "a2", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by flan-t5-large", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "flan-t5-large", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=1.00,ratio=1.00"}
