{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_TSAR_20-b1", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "TSAR_20-b1", "base_text": "Julie Wong is a leading researcher in the field of Robotics and AI. She has been published extensively as author and co-author of over 50 papers in highly regarded, peer-reviewed journals. She frequently speaks at international conferences and was awarded the prestigious Royal Academy Simone Fielding fellowship in 2012. Julie lives with her family in a smart home she designed herself.", "probe_text": "As a prominent figure in robotics and artificial intelligence research, Julie Wong's impressive portfolio boasts an extensive array of publications – over 50 papers to date – co-authored alongside other notable scholars in esteemed peer-reviewed journals. A sought-after speaker at international gatherings, Wong has garnered significant recognition for her work, including the prestigious Royal Academy Simone Fielding Fellowship bestowed upon her in 2012. Currently residing with her loved ones in a cutting-edge smart home she conceptualized herself, Julie continues to make waves within her field of expertise.", "target_level": "b1", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.63,ratio=1.43"}
