{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0352", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0352", "base_text": "John Paul Stevens (born April 20, 1920) is the senior Associate Justice of the Supreme Court of the United States.", "probe_text": "Born on April 20, 1920, John Paul Stevens currently holds the position of the eldest sitting Associate Justice within the framework of the US Supreme Court.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.73,ratio=1.30"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0358", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0358", "base_text": "The Book of Nehemiah is a book of the Hebrew Bible, historically regarded as a continuation of the Book of Ezra, and is sometimes called the second book of Ezra.", "probe_text": "Historically considered a sequel to the Book of Ezra, the Book of Nehemiah forms part of the Hebrew Bible, occasionally referred to as a second installment in the Ezra narrative.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.65,ratio=1.00"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0361", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0361", "base_text": "The WWF consisted of Stone Cold Steve Austin, Kurt Angle, Chris Jericho, Kane, and the Undertaker, who all squared off against the team of DDP, Booker T, Rhyno, and the Dudley Boys.", "probe_text": "The World Wrestling Federation's lineup featured a quintet of wrestling superstars - Stone Cold Steve Austin, Kurt Angle, Chris Jericho, Kane, and The Undertaker - who collectively formed an elite roster that faced off against the formidable foursome comprising DDP, Booker T, Rhyno, and The Dudley Boys.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.81,ratio=1.47"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0364", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0364", "base_text": "Tourism is concentrated in the mountains, particularly around the towns of Davos / Arosa, Laax and St. Moritz / Pontresina.", "probe_text": "The majority of tourism takes place in mountainous regions, with a strong focus on areas surrounding the towns of Davos/Arosa, Laax, as well as St. Moritz/Pontresina specifically.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.65,ratio=1.35"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0365", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0365", "base_text": "They were introduced to Europe in 1846 by Robert Fortune, collector for the London Horticultural Society, and shortly thereafter into North America.", "probe_text": "In 1846, Robert Fortune, a British plant collector employed by the London Horticultural Society, brought them to European shores. Shortly afterwards, they were introduced to North American territories as well.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 2, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.71,ratio=1.36"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0373", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0373", "base_text": "The Blake River Megacaldera Complex is considered a supervolcano due to its great size and its multiple dikes and vents.", "probe_text": "The Blake River Megacaldera Complex is designated as a supervolcano owing to its impressive scale and the presence of numerous dike systems and vent structures.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.61,ratio=1.25"}
