{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0424", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0424", "base_text": "The Official Municipality Key, formerly also known as the Official Municipality Characteristic Number or Municipality Code Number, is a number sequence for the identification of politically independent municipalities or unincorporated areas.", "probe_text": "Formerly referred to as either the Official Municipality Identification Number or Municipal Code Identifier, The Official Municipality Key is an identifier consisting of a numerical sequence used to distinguish municipalities that are politically autonomous from those without municipal incorporation.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.70,ratio=1.26"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0426", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0426", "base_text": "In 2005, Stallone also inducted wrestling icon Hulk Hogan, who appeared in Rocky III as a wrestler named Thunderlips, into the WWE Hall of Fame; Stallone was also the person who offered Hogan the cameo in Rocky III.", "probe_text": "In 2005, Stallone initiated the induction of Hulk Hogan, a legendary figure known for his wrestling prowess and memorable appearance as Thunderlips in Rocky III, into the WWE Hall of Fame; Hogan's iconic role in the film was, in fact, facilitated by Stallone.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.63,ratio=1.13"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0431", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0431", "base_text": "Neodymium is a chemical element with the symbol Nd and atomic number 60.", "probe_text": "The chemical element neodymium bears the symbol Nd and has an atomic number of sixty.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.75,ratio=1.15"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0435", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0435", "base_text": "Stone Cold then dragged a referee into the ring, but in a swerve, kicked Kurt Angle in the face, hit him with a Stunner, and placed Booker T on top of Kurt Angle and told the referee to count.", "probe_text": "Stone Cold subsequently pulled a ringside official into the ring, only to catch Kurt Angle off guard by kicking him in the jaw, delivering a thunderous Stunner that sent him crashing to the mat, before positioning Booker T on top of the stunned Angle and instructing the referee to commence counting.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.63,ratio=1.31"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0443", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0443", "base_text": "A Feast for Crows is the fourth of seven planned novels in A Song of Ice and Fire, an epic fantasy series by American author George R. R. Martin.", "probe_text": "George R. R. Martin's A Song of Ice and Fire, a sweeping fantasy saga, comprises seven volumes, with A Feast for Crows being the fourth installment penned by this renowned American storyteller.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.69,ratio=1.10"}
