{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0518", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0518", "base_text": "The family moved to Vienna in 1907 where it changed the Czech Slavic name of \"Zajtich\" to the invented German \"Seyss-Inquart\".", "probe_text": "In 1907, the family relocated to Vienna and subsequently altered their traditional Czech Slavic surname \"Zajtich\", adopting a fabricated German equivalent, Seyss-Inquart.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.61,ratio=1.05"}
