{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0877", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0877", "base_text": "Name In Chinese, the region is known as \"Inner Mongolia\", where the terms of \"Inner / Outer\" are derived from Manchu dorgi / tulergi.", "probe_text": "In Chinese parlance, the area is referred to as \"Inner Mongolia\", with the qualifiers \"Inner\" and \"Outer\" originating from the Manchu dialect's \"dorgi\" and \"tulergi\".", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.60,ratio=1.04"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0878", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0878", "base_text": "Ipswich were elected to The Football League on 30 May, 1938, and played in Division Three (South) until the end of the 1953 – 54 season, when they won the title and promotion to Division Two.", "probe_text": "Ipswich earned a place in The Football League on May 30th, 1938. They participated in Division Three (South) up until the conclusion of the 1953-54 campaign, at which point they secured the championship and automatic advancement to Division Two.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.64,ratio=1.08"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0884", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0884", "base_text": "Helmut Heinrich Waldemar Schmidt (born 23 December 1918) is a German Social Democratic politician who served as Chancellor of West Germany from 1974 to 1982.", "probe_text": "West Germany's Chancellor between 1974 and 1982, Schmidt was born Helmut Heinrich Waldemar on December 23, 1918. He is a prominent German Social Democrat politician.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.67,ratio=1.00"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0885", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0885", "base_text": "Ohio State has also won national championships in men's swimming & diving, men's outdoor track & field, men's golf, men's gymnastics, men's fencing, co-ed fencing, and multiple synchronized swimming championships.", "probe_text": "In addition to its titles in football, the Ohio State University has secured national championships across various disciplines, including men's aquatic sports, men's track and field events, men's golf tournaments, men's gymnastics competitions, men's fencing matches, co-ed fencing contests, and multiple synchronized swimming awards.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.83,ratio=1.47"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0894", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0894", "base_text": "In the canonical Watson-Crick base pairing, adenine (A) forms a base pair with thymine (T), as does guanine (G) with cytosine (C) in DNA.", "probe_text": "According to the fundamental structure of Watson and Crick's model, adenine (A) pairs up with thymine (T), while guanine (G) similarly pairs with cytosine (C) within the genetic molecule known as DNA.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.67,ratio=1.33"}
