{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0985", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0985", "base_text": "Retrieved 2008 - 12 - 25 Album information The title of the album, \"A Little Bit Longer\", comes from their song of the same name, which Nick Jonas wrote about his dealings with having type 1 diabetes.", "probe_text": "According to records last accessed on December 25, 2008, album details are as follows: The title of this record, \"A Little Bit Longer\", originates from a song with the same name. The latter was penned by Nick Jonas, and it is an account of his personal experiences living with type 1 diabetes.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.67,ratio=1.41"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_0991", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0991", "base_text": "Individual songs from some of the operettas have become standards, notably \"Vilja\" from The Merry Widow and \"You Are My Heart's Delight\" (\"Dein ist mein ganzes Herz\") from The Land of Smiles.", "probe_text": "Some notable numbers from various operettas have achieved widespread popularity as classic songs; most notably, \"Vilja\" from The Merry Widow and the ever-beloved \"You Are My Heart's Delight,\" also known as \"Dein ist mein ganzes Herz,\" featured in The Land of Smiles.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.89,ratio=1.31"}
