{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_1736", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_1736", "base_text": "In The Tomb of the Cybermen (1967), veins and brains were visible through the domed head of the Cyberman Controller and similarly, in Attack of the Cybermen (1985) and \"The Age of Steel\" (2006), the Cyber-Controller's brain is visible through the dome.", "probe_text": "In the 1967 serial The Tomb of the Cybermen, it was possible to see both veins and brain tissue through the dome-shaped head of a Cyberman controller. This visual trait is also evident in Attack of the Cybermen (1985) and \"The Age of Steel\" (2006), where the central nervous system of a Cyber-Controller can be observed through its transparent dome-like structure.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.75,ratio=1.45"}
