{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-8b_ASSET_val_1952", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_1952", "base_text": "As the last album of the Scandinavian vocal music series, Pohjola produced a tribute to the Finnish legendary tango composer, Toivo Kärki on the album, Leivonen lumimyrskyssä (A Lark in a Snowstorm) (2006).", "probe_text": "Concluding the Scandinavian vocal music collection, Pohjola dedicated its final installment, the 2006 album \"Leivonen lumimyrskyssä\" (A Lark in a Snowstorm), to Toivo Kärki, Finland's celebrated tango composer, in commemoration of his legendary legacy.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-8b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.74,ratio=1.03"}
