{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_qwen2.5-32b_ASSET_val_0810", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0810", "base_text": "Held from 17 June to 19 June 1944, this celebration was referred to as the \"The Jubilee Celebrations of IOC\" by Carl Diem, the originator of the modern tradition of the Olympic torch relay.", "probe_text": "From June 17 to June 19, 1944, this event was named \"The Jubilee Celebrations of IOC\" by Carl Diem, who initiated the contemporary practice of the Olympic flame relay.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by qwen2.5-32b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "qwen2.5-32b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.65,ratio=0.85"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_qwen2.5-32b_ASSET_val_0811", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0811", "base_text": "After the mutiny Following the Indian Mutiny of 1857 - 58 and the consequent abolition of the East India Company, its European regiments were amalgamated in 1860 with the British Army, but its ‘ Native ’ regiments were not.", "probe_text": "Post the Indian Mutiny in 1857-58, which led to the dissolution of the East India Company, there was a merger of its European forces with the British Army in 1860; however, this amalgamation did not include its ‘Native’ regiments.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by qwen2.5-32b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "qwen2.5-32b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.67,ratio=1.00"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_qwen2.5-32b_ASSET_val_0813", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0813", "base_text": "Naming and records After all of the twenty one predetermined hurricane names for the 2005 season were exhausted following Hurricane Wilma, the Greek alphabet was used, beginning with Tropical Storm Alpha.", "probe_text": "Following the usage of all twenty-one preselected names for the 2005 hurricane season up to and including Hurricane Wilma, the Greek alphabet was then utilized, starting with Tropical Storm Alpha.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by qwen2.5-32b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "qwen2.5-32b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.70,ratio=0.97"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_qwen2.5-32b_ASSET_val_0814", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0814", "base_text": "Associativity of addition: For any integers, a, b and c, (a + b) + c = a + (b + c).", "probe_text": "Property of associative addition: For all integers a, b, and c, the equation (a + b) + c equals a + (b + c).", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by qwen2.5-32b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "qwen2.5-32b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.80,ratio=1.14"}
