{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_gemma-3-27b_ASSET_val_0426", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0426", "base_text": "In 2005, Stallone also inducted wrestling icon Hulk Hogan, who appeared in Rocky III as a wrestler named Thunderlips, into the WWE Hall of Fame; Stallone was also the person who offered Hogan the cameo in Rocky III.", "probe_text": "Sylvester Stallone similarly honored wrestling legend Hulk Hogan in 2005 with an induction into the WWE Hall of Fame—Hogan had previously played the role of Thunderlips, a wrestler, in Stallone’s *Rocky III*, a part Stallone himself had offered to him.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by gemma-3-27b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "gemma-3-27b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.63,ratio=1.05"}
