{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_gemma-3-27b_ASSET_val_0811", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0811", "base_text": "After the mutiny Following the Indian Mutiny of 1857 - 58 and the consequent abolition of the East India Company, its European regiments were amalgamated in 1860 with the British Army, but its ‘ Native ’ regiments were not.", "probe_text": "Subsequent to the 1857-58 Indian Rebellion and the resulting dissolution of the East India Company, its forces comprised of European soldiers were integrated into the British Army in 1860; however, its regiments of Indian soldiers were not included in this consolidation.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by gemma-3-27b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "gemma-3-27b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.62,ratio=1.05"}
