{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_flan-t5-xl_TSAR_08-a2", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "TSAR_08-a2", "base_text": "Dreams of a phone call from an old friend or the death of someone close, for example, are more likely to be the result of coincidence than prophecy. And, of course, we probably choose to forget all the times we dream about such events but they don't happen.", "probe_text": "Dreams of a phone call from an old friend or the death of someone close, for example, are more likely to be the result of coincidence than prophecy. And, of course, we probably choose to forget all the times we dream about such events but they do n't happen.", "target_level": "a2", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by flan-t5-xl", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "flan-t5-xl", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.98,ratio=1.02"}
