{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_flan-t5-xl_TSAR_09-a2", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "TSAR_09-a2", "base_text": "Some bridge collapses are mysteries, and engineers only realise why after they conduct a complete investigation. In some cases, this could happen because inferior-quality material was used in the construction, or because of a defect in a key piece of the bridge. In other cases, the bridge was designed only to support a certain amount of weight and no more.", "probe_text": "Some bridge collapses are mysteries , and engineers only realize why after they conduct a complete investigation. In some cases , this could happen because inferior-quality material was used in the construction , or because of a defect in a key piece of the bridge. In other cases , the bridge was designed only to support a certain amount of weight and no more.", "target_level": "a2", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by flan-t5-xl", "tier": 1, "dataset": "TSAR2025", "generator_model": "flan-t5-xl", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.98,ratio=1.07"}
