{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-70b_ASSET_val_0940", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0940", "base_text": "Education The Cabarrus County School System services all of the county with the exception of parts of Kannapolis, which operates its own school district.", "probe_text": "The Cabarrus County School System provides educational services to the entire county, with the sole exception of certain areas within Kannapolis, where a separate school district is responsible for operations.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-70b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-70b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.61,ratio=1.25"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-70b_ASSET_val_0943", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0943", "base_text": "The BCG matrix (aka B. C. G. analysis, BCG-matrix, Boston Box, Boston Matrix, Boston Consulting Group analysis) is a chart that had been created by Bruce Henderson for the Boston Consulting Group in 1970 to help corporations with analyzing their business units or product lines.", "probe_text": "In 1970, Bruce Henderson developed a graphical tool for the Boston Consulting Group, known by several names including the BCG matrix, BCG analysis, Boston Box, and Boston Matrix, which is designed to assist companies in evaluating their various business units or product portfolios.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-70b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-70b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.60,ratio=0.96"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-70b_ASSET_val_0945", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0945", "base_text": "The town is one end point of the Murray to the Mountains Rail Trail.", "probe_text": "The town serves as a terminal point for the Murray to the Mountains Rail Trail.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-70b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-70b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.67,ratio=1.07"}
{"probe_id": "INV_SEM_llama-3.1-70b_ASSET_val_0947", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0947", "base_text": "Helene was a long-lived Cape Verde-type hurricane that formed in the extreme southeastern part of the North Atlantic Ocean, peaking as a Category 3 hurricane on the Saffir-Simpson hurricane scale as it traversed the central Atlantic.", "probe_text": "Helene was a hurricane of unusual duration, classified as a Cape Verde-type storm, which originated in the far southeastern reaches of the North Atlantic and reached its maximum intensity as a Category 3 system on the Saffir-Simpson scale while crossing the central portion of the Atlantic.", "target_level": "simpler", "expected_relation": "stable", "operation": "paraphrase by llama-3.1-70b", "tier": 1, "dataset": "ASSET", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-70b", "rule_pass": true, "rule_detail": "recall=0.67,ratio=1.28"}
