{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gpt_4_1_ASSET_val_0814_4be0f954", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gpt-4.1", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_0814", "base_text": "Associativity of addition: For any integers, a, b and c, (a + b) + c = a + (b + c).", "probe_text": "The associative property of addition states that for all integers a, b, and c, adding a and b first and then c gives the same result as adding b and c first and then a; that is, (a + b) + c equals a + (b + c).", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
