{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0033_f724d268", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0033", "base_text": "Fearing that Drek will destroy the galaxy, Clank asks Ratchet to help him find the famous superhero Captain Qwark, in an effort to stop Drek.", "probe_text": "With a sense of urgency, Clank turns to Ratchet for assistance, hoping together they can locate the renowned hero Captain Qwark and enlist his aid in thwarting Drek's galaxy-threatening plans.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gpt_4_1_ASSET_val_1725_211a5394", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gpt-4.1", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_1725", "base_text": "The rotational period of the interior of Uranus is 17 hours, 14 minutes.", "probe_text": "Uranus’s interior completes one rotation in 17 hours and 14 minutes.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_70b_TSAR_13-b1_c5e57552", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-70b", "base_item_id": "TSAR_13-b1", "base_text": "Many of the major supermarket chains have come under fire with accusations of various unethical acts over the past decade. They've wasted tonnes of food, they've underpaid their suppliers and they've contributed to excessive plastic waste in their packaging, which has had its impact on our environment. But supermarkets and grocers are starting to sit up and take notice. In response to growing consumer backlash against the huge amounts of plastic waste generated by plastic packaging, some of the largest UK supermarkets have signed up to a pact promising to transform packaging and cut plastic wastage.", "probe_text": "Over the past decade, numerous prominent supermarket chains have faced intense criticism for alleged wrongdoing. Critics point to their role in squandering vast amounts of food, shortchanging suppliers on payments, and perpetuating excessive plastic waste through their packaging choices, all of which have taken a toll on the environment. However, supermarkets and grocery stores are beginning to take heed. In reaction to mounting public outcry over the staggering quantities of plastic waste produced by single-use packaging, several major UK supermarket chains have committed to an agreement aimed at revolutionizing their packaging strategies and significantly reducing plastic waste.", "target_level": "b1", "dataset": "TSAR2025", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0034_e2363751", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0034", "base_text": "He advocates applying a user-centered design process in product development cycles and also works towards popularizing interaction design as a mainstream discipline.", "probe_text": "He champions an approach to product development that puts users at its core, and is actively promoting the widespread adoption of interaction design as a respected field.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 2, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gpt_4_1_ASSET_val_1727_ff3390ef", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gpt-4.1", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_1727", "base_text": "Meteorological history A cut-off extratropical cyclone over the central north Pacific moved over an area of ocean with sea surface temperatures as high as 2 ° C above normal for two days.", "probe_text": "Meteorological history For two days, a detached extratropical cyclone in the central northern Pacific traveled across a region of ocean where sea surface temperatures were up to 2 °C warmer than usual.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gpt_4_1_ASSET_val_1726_58e56f5e", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gpt-4.1", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_1726", "base_text": "The series attempted to create a setting of a gritty, realistic police station similar to that of NYPD Blue, but differed by focusing on the uniformed police officers rather than the detectives.", "probe_text": "The show aimed to establish a gritty and realistic police station environment like NYPD Blue, but set itself apart by centering on uniformed officers instead of detectives.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gpt_4_1_ASSET_val_1729_f1b54174", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gpt-4.1", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_1729", "base_text": "Like most brooms, it has apparently leafless stems that in spring and summer are covered in profuse golden-yellow flowers.", "probe_text": "Similar to other brooms, its stems appear to lack leaves and are abundantly adorned with golden-yellow flowers during the spring and summer.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
