{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0050_188ff911", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0050", "base_text": "Aside from this, Cameron has often worked in Christian-themed productions, among them the post-Rapture films Left Behind: The Movie, Left Behind II: Tribulation Force, and Left Behind: World at War, in which he plays Cameron \"Buck\" Williams.", "probe_text": "In addition to his other work, Cameron has frequently appeared in Christian-themed projects, including the post-apocalyptic films Left Behind: The Movie, Left Behind II: Tribulation Force, and Left Behind: World at War. In these productions, he portrays Cameron \"Buck\" Williams.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_70b_TSAR_13-a2_29ee2522", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-70b", "base_item_id": "TSAR_13-a2", "base_text": "Many of the major supermarket chains have come under fire with accusations of various unethical acts over the past decade. They've wasted tonnes of food, they've underpaid their suppliers and they've contributed to excessive plastic waste in their packaging, which has had its impact on our environment. But supermarkets and grocers are starting to sit up and take notice. In response to growing consumer backlash against the huge amounts of plastic waste generated by plastic packaging, some of the largest UK supermarkets have signed up to a pact promising to transform packaging and cut plastic wastage.", "probe_text": "Over the past decade, numerous major supermarket chains have faced criticism for alleged unethical practices. These include discarding vast quantities of food, undercompensating suppliers, and perpetuating excessive plastic waste through their packaging methods, ultimately harming the environment. However, supermarkets and grocery stores are beginning to acknowledge these concerns. In reaction to mounting consumer discontent with the substantial amounts of plastic waste produced by packaging, several prominent UK supermarkets have committed to a pledge aimed at revolutionizing packaging and reducing plastic waste.", "target_level": "a2", "dataset": "TSAR2025", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gpt_4_1_ASSET_val_1774_68996a29", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gpt-4.1", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_1774", "base_text": "In the fall of 2006, Cavergno and Bignasco were incorporated into the municipality, despite an attempt by Bignasco to resist the incorporation in the courts.", "probe_text": "During autumn 2006, Cavergno and Bignasco became part of the municipality, although Bignasco tried to oppose the merger through legal action.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
