{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gpt_4_1_ASSET_val_1960_8e3dd765", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gpt-4.1", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_1960", "base_text": "However, the council was delayed until 1545, and convened right before Luther's death.", "probe_text": "Nevertheless, the council did not take place until 1545 and was assembled just prior to Luther’s death.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gemma_3_27b_TSAR_10-a2_cfa0cd95", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gemma-3-27b", "base_item_id": "TSAR_10-a2", "base_text": "I used to do a typical five-day week, but after I came out of my parental leave, I decided that I wanted to spend more time with my children before they start school. After negotiating with my boss, we decided to cut my working week down to a three-day work week. This of course meant a significant cut in my pay too, as I'm paid on a pro-rata basis. I've since noticed, though, that my workload hasn't decreased in the slightest! I'm now doing five days' worth of work in three days, but getting paid much less for it!", "probe_text": "Previously, my work schedule consisted of the standard five days a week; however, following my return from parental leave, I resolved to dedicate more time to my kids while they were still young and before they began formal education. Following discussions with my manager, we agreed to reduce my work week to three days. Naturally, this also resulted in a considerable reduction in my earnings, as my compensation is calculated proportionally. I have observed, however, that my amount of work has not diminished at all! I am currently completing the same volume of tasks in three days that I used to in five, yet receiving a substantially lower salary for it.", "target_level": "a2", "dataset": "TSAR2025", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
