{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gpt_4_1_ASSET_val_1988_a8e886fa", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gpt-4.1", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_1988", "base_text": "Schneier designed Blowfish as a general-purpose algorithm, intended as a replacement for the aging DES and free of the problems and constraints associated with other algorithms.", "probe_text": "Blowfish was created by Schneier to serve as a versatile algorithm, meant to replace the outdated DES and avoid the issues and limitations found in other algorithms.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
