{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gpt_4_1_ASSET_val_1992_6231c937", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gpt-4.1", "base_item_id": "ASSET_val_1992", "base_text": "In practice, however, the definition means that high-precision realizations of the second should compensate for the effects of the ambient temperature (black-body radiation) within which atomic clocks operate, and extrapolate accordingly to the value of the second at a temperature of absolute zero.", "probe_text": "In reality, this definition requires that highly accurate measurements of the second account for the influence of the surrounding temperature (black-body radiation) affecting atomic clocks, and adjust the value to reflect what the second would be at absolute zero temperature.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0121_2a59112e", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0121", "base_text": "James I appointed him a Gentleman of the Chapel Royal, where he served as an organist from at least 1615 until his death.", "probe_text": "Appointed by King James I, he was designated a member of the prestigious Chapel Royal, and it was there that he fulfilled the role of organist for a period spanning at least twenty years prior to his passing.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gemma_3_27b_TSAR_10-b1_85569e7a", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gemma-3-27b", "base_item_id": "TSAR_10-b1", "base_text": "I used to do a typical five-day week, but after I came out of my parental leave, I decided that I wanted to spend more time with my children before they start school. After negotiating with my boss, we decided to cut my working week down to a three-day work week. This of course meant a significant cut in my pay too, as I'm paid on a pro-rata basis. I've since noticed, though, that my workload hasn't decreased in the slightest! I'm now doing five days' worth of work in three days, but getting paid much less for it!", "probe_text": "Previously, my work schedule consisted of the standard five days a week; however, following my return from parental leave, I resolved to dedicate more time to my kids while they were still young and pre-school aged. Following discussions with my manager, we agreed to reduce my work week to three days. Naturally, this also resulted in a considerable reduction in my earnings, as my compensation is calculated proportionally. I have observed, however, that my amount of work has not diminished at all! I am currently completing the same volume of tasks in three days that I used to in five, yet receiving a substantially lower salary for it.", "target_level": "b1", "dataset": "TSAR2025", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0122_6b4b9c3a", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0122", "base_text": "Chauvin was embarrassed to receive his award and initially indicated that he may not accept it.", "probe_text": "Chauvin felt mortified at being honored with the award, and at first seemed hesitant to even consider accepting it.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0123_a93b81d6", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0123", "base_text": "Later, Esperanto speakers began to see the language and the culture that had grown up around it as ends in themselves, even if Esperanto is never adopted by the United Nations or other international organizations.", "probe_text": "As time went on, Esperanto enthusiasts started viewing the language itself and the distinct cultural identity surrounding it as self-contained entities, regardless of whether Esperanto becomes an official language at the United Nations or other global institutions.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_70b_TSAR_18-a2_74ce3758", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-70b", "base_item_id": "TSAR_18-a2", "base_text": "Unlike many other best-selling album artists, Springsteen is still releasing chart-topping, stadium-filling new music and remains at the top of his game in his late 60s. It doesn't surprise me at all. This is a man who tells us our most fundamental stories about ourselves and, when you listen to Born in the USA, those stories are as relevant today as they ever were.", "probe_text": "In contrast to numerous other artists with best-selling albums, Springsteen continues to produce new music that reaches the top of the charts and fills stadiums, maintaining his position at the pinnacle of his career well into his 60s. This comes as no surprise to me. As a masterful storyteller, he conveys our most essential narratives about ourselves, and upon listening to Born in the USA, it becomes clear that these stories remain just as pertinent now as they have ever been.", "target_level": "a2", "dataset": "TSAR2025", "tier": 2, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0124_90e53065", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0124", "base_text": "Dry air wrapping around the southern periphery of the cyclone eroded most of the deep convection by early on September 12.", "probe_text": "By September 12, dry air encircling the outer rim of the storm had largely dissipated the intense thunderstorm activity that had developed earlier.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0125_476fa9c8", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0125", "base_text": "Eva Anna Paula Braun, died Eva Anna Paula Hitler (6 February 1912 – 30 April 1945) was the longtime companion and, for a brief time, wife of Adolf Hitler.", "probe_text": "Eva Braun, who later became Eva Hitler, lived from 6 February 1912 to 30 April 1945. For nearly her entire life, she maintained a close relationship with Adolf Hitler, eventually marrying him briefly before his death.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gemma_3_27b_TSAR_11-a2_9f278e17", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gemma-3-27b", "base_item_id": "TSAR_11-a2", "base_text": "Much of today's business is conducted across international borders, and while the majority of the global business community might share the use of English as a common language, the nuances and expectations of business communication might differ greatly from culture to culture. A lack of understanding of the cultural norms and practices of our business acquaintances can result in unfair judgements, misunderstandings and breakdowns in communication. Here are three basic areas of differences in the business etiquette around the world that could help stand you in good stead when you next find yourself working with someone from a different culture.", "probe_text": "A significant amount of commercial activity now takes place internationally, and although English is frequently used as a shared language within the global business world, the subtle details and anticipated behaviors of professional communication can vary considerably between cultures. Failing to appreciate the customary norms and practices of international colleagues may lead to inaccurate assessments, confusion, and communication failures. The following three key areas of differing business customs can be beneficial when collaborating with individuals from diverse cultural backgrounds.", "target_level": "a2", "dataset": "TSAR2025", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0126_fb60e103", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0126", "base_text": "Most IRC servers do not require users to register an account but a user will have to set a nickname before being connected.", "probe_text": "While many IRC servers don't necessitate registration, users are still required to establish a unique nickname prior to establishing a connection.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0129_31125e0c", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0129", "base_text": "Usually portrayed as being bald, with long whiskers, he is said to be an incarnation of the Southern Polestar.", "probe_text": "Typically depicted without hair, sporting lengthy facial hair, it's claimed that this figure embodies the spirit of the Southern Celestial Pole.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0130_a4bab3d4", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0130", "base_text": "A few animals have chromatic response, changing color in changing environments, either seasonally (ermine, snowshoe hare) or far more rapidly with chromatophores in their integument (the cephalopod family).", "probe_text": "Some species exhibit adaptive colouration, shifting hues to suit their surroundings, whether annually as seen in the ermine and snowshoe hare, or much more swiftly through the presence of chromatophores within their skin, a trait characteristic of cephalopods.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_70b_TSAR_18-b1_1c6b448a", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-70b", "base_item_id": "TSAR_18-b1", "base_text": "Unlike many other best-selling album artists, Springsteen is still releasing chart-topping, stadium-filling new music and remains at the top of his game in his late 60s. It doesn't surprise me at all. This is a man who tells us our most fundamental stories about ourselves and, when you listen to Born in the USA, those stories are as relevant today as they ever were.", "probe_text": "In contrast to numerous other successful album artists, Springsteen continues to produce new music that reaches the top of the charts and packs stadiums, maintaining his position at the pinnacle of his career well into his sixties. This comes as no surprise to me. As a masterful storyteller, he conveys our most essential narratives about ourselves, and listening to Born in the USA reveals that these stories remain just as pertinent now as they have ever been.", "target_level": "b1", "dataset": "TSAR2025", "tier": 2, "source": "patch_v1"}
