{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_70b_TSAR_19-b1_7af5a8b8", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-70b", "base_item_id": "TSAR_19-b1", "base_text": "More questions lie in looking at the influence of genetics on brain and language development. Are there genes that mutated and gave us language ability? Researchers have found a gene mutation that occurred between 200,000 and 100,000 years ago, which seems to have a connection with speaking and how our brains control our mouths and face. Monkeys have a similar gene, but it did not undergo this mutation. It's too early to say how much influence genes have on language, but one day the answers might be found in our DNA.", "probe_text": "Further inquiry is warranted into the role of genetics in shaping brain and language development. Did specific genetic mutations confer upon us the capacity for language? A gene mutation discovered by researchers, which occurred between 200,000 and 100,000 years ago, appears to be linked to speech production and the neural mechanisms governing facial and oral motor control. Interestingly, a comparable gene is present in monkeys, yet it did not undergo this particular mutation. While the extent of genetic influence on language remains unclear, future research may uncover the answers within our genetic code.", "target_level": "b1", "dataset": "TSAR2025", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0146_f43f5067", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0146", "base_text": "Shi'a Muslims consider Karbala to be one of their holiest cities after Mecca, Medina, Jerusalem and Najaf.", "probe_text": "Among Shia Muslims, Karbala is regarded as a city of paramount sacredness, ranking alongside Mecca, Medina, Jerusalem, and Najaf.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0147_1d38eee3", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0147", "base_text": "The PAD called for the resignation of the governments of Thaksin Shinawatra, Samak Sundaravej and Somchai Wongsawat, whom the PAD accused of being proxies for Thaksin.", "probe_text": "The People's Alliance for Democracy demanded that the governments led by Thaksin Shinawatra, Samak Sundaravej, and Somchai Wongsawat step down from office, claiming they were mere puppets controlled by Thaksin.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0148_4ef7534c", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0148", "base_text": "However travel through very remote areas, on isolated tracks, requires advance planning and a suitable, reliable vehicle (usually a four wheel drive).", "probe_text": "Venturing into extremely secluded regions via uncharted paths necessitates meticulous prior preparation and the possession of a sturdy, dependable vehicle typically equipped with all-wheel drive capabilities.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_gemma_3_27b_TSAR_13-a2_4e116da3", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "gemma-3-27b", "base_item_id": "TSAR_13-a2", "base_text": "Many of the major supermarket chains have come under fire with accusations of various unethical acts over the past decade. They've wasted tonnes of food, they've underpaid their suppliers and they've contributed to excessive plastic waste in their packaging, which has had its impact on our environment. But supermarkets and grocers are starting to sit up and take notice. In response to growing consumer backlash against the huge amounts of plastic waste generated by plastic packaging, some of the largest UK supermarkets have signed up to a pact promising to transform packaging and cut plastic wastage.", "probe_text": "Over the last ten years, numerous large supermarket groups have faced criticism regarding a range of questionable practices. This includes significant food waste, insufficient payments to those who supply them, and a contribution to the problem of excessive plastic packaging – all of which has negatively affected the environment. However, supermarkets are now beginning to address these issues. Driven by increasing public disapproval of the considerable plastic waste created by packaging, several of the biggest supermarket companies in the UK have committed to an agreement to redesign packaging and reduce plastic waste.", "target_level": "a2", "dataset": "TSAR2025", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0149_ab276ac7", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0149", "base_text": "While at Kahn he was chief architect for the Fisher Building in 1928.", "probe_text": "As a principal designer at Kahn, he held the position of lead architect on the Fisher Building project during 1928.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0151_e1cc4e8f", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0151", "base_text": "Britpop emerged from the British independent music scene of the early 1990s and was characterised by bands influenced by British guitar pop music of the 1960s and 1970s.", "probe_text": "In the UK's underground music landscape of the early 1990s, a distinct sound known as Britpop began to take shape. It owed its roots to the iconic guitar-driven pop of Britain's 1960s and 1970s musical heritage.", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_70b_TSAR_20-a2_d1d990ea", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-70b", "base_item_id": "TSAR_20-a2", "base_text": "Julie Wong is a leading researcher in the field of Robotics and AI. She has been published extensively as author and co-author of over 50 papers in highly regarded, peer-reviewed journals. She frequently speaks at international conferences and was awarded the prestigious Royal Academy Simone Fielding fellowship in 2012. Julie lives with her family in a smart home she designed herself.", "probe_text": "As a prominent figure in Robotics and Artificial Intelligence, Julie Wong boasts an impressive publication record, having authored or co-authored over 50 papers featured in esteemed, peer-reviewed journals. Her expertise is frequently showcased through presentations at global conferences, and her accomplishments were recognized with the distinguished Royal Academy Simone Fielding fellowship in 2012. Outside of her professional pursuits, Julie resides with her family in a cutting-edge smart home that she personally designed.", "target_level": "a2", "dataset": "TSAR2025", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
