{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_70b_TSAR_20-b1_5445695b", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-70b", "base_item_id": "TSAR_20-b1", "base_text": "Julie Wong is a leading researcher in the field of Robotics and AI. She has been published extensively as author and co-author of over 50 papers in highly regarded, peer-reviewed journals. She frequently speaks at international conferences and was awarded the prestigious Royal Academy Simone Fielding fellowship in 2012. Julie lives with her family in a smart home she designed herself.", "probe_text": "As a prominent figure in Robotics and AI research, Julie Wong boasts an impressive publication record, having authored or co-authored over 50 papers featured in esteemed, peer-reviewed journals. Her expertise is frequently sought after at international conferences, where she shares her insights with global audiences. In recognition of her outstanding contributions, Wong was honored with the distinguished Royal Academy Simone Fielding fellowship in 2012. Outside of her professional pursuits, Julie resides with her family in a cutting-edge smart home that showcases her innovative design skills.", "target_level": "b1", "dataset": "TSAR2025", "tier": 1, "source": "patch_v1"}
{"probe_id": "patch_sem_llama_3_1_8b_ASSET_test_0159_ba0e5955", "probe_family": "invariance", "probe_subtype": "semantic", "generator_model": "llama-3.1-8b", "base_item_id": "ASSET_test_0159", "base_text": "He followed this with several other pieces about Hiawatha: The Death of Minnehaha, Overture to The Song of Hiawatha and Hiawatha's Departure.", "probe_text": "Following that, he composed a series of additional works centered around the legendary figure of Hiawatha, including \"The Death of Minnehaha\", an overture for his epic poem \"The Song of Hiawatha\", as well as \"Hiawatha's Departure\".", "target_level": "simpler", "dataset": "ASSET", "tier": 2, "source": "patch_v1"}
